{%- comment -%}
  gs-logo: inline SVG logos (DESIGN.md §8). Draft reference: untested until the theme is pulled.
  Liquid can't render a snippet chosen by a variable, so each website logo is a named case.
  The gs-logo-*.liquid files are generated by design-system/scripts/build_logo_snippets.py.

  Params
    name   one of the cases below
    label  blank = organisation name as the accessible name; 'decorative' = hidden from
           assistive tech (use inside a link that already has an accessible name)

  Header example:
    <a class="gs-header__logo" href="{{ routes.root_url }}" aria-label="Gordon Smith Gallery, home">
      {%- render 'gs-logo', name: 'gallery-simple-stacked-colour-box', label: 'decorative' -%}
    </a>
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- case name -%}
  {%- when 'gallery-simple-stacked-colour-box' -%}{%- render 'gs-logo-gallery-simple-stacked-colour-box', label: label -%}
  {%- when 'gallery-simple-horizontal-colour-box' -%}{%- render 'gs-logo-gallery-simple-horizontal-colour-box', label: label -%}
  {%- when 'gallery-full-stacked-colour-box' -%}{%- render 'gs-logo-gallery-full-stacked-colour-box', label: label -%}
  {%- when 'gallery-simple-stacked-white' -%}{%- render 'gs-logo-gallery-simple-stacked-white', label: label -%}
  {%- when 'artists-for-kids-full-colour-box' -%}{%- render 'gs-logo-artists-for-kids-full-colour-box', label: label -%}
  {%- when 'artists-for-kids-full-white' -%}{%- render 'gs-logo-artists-for-kids-full-white', label: label -%}
  {%- when 'foundation-simple-colour-box' -%}{%- render 'gs-logo-foundation-simple-colour-box', label: label -%}
  {%- when 'foundation-simple-white' -%}{%- render 'gs-logo-foundation-simple-white', label: label -%}
  {%- else -%}
    {%- if request.design_mode -%}<span class="gs-editor-warning">Unknown logo "{{ name | escape }}".</span>{%- endif -%}
{%- endcase -%}
